  "_README": [
    "Reviewed map from a product_type to the product_types that COMPLEMENT it, best",
    "first. Every value must exist in the catalog; scripts/check_lexicon.py fails the",
    "build otherwise.",
    "",
    "A complement is worn or carried WITH the item. A substitute is an alternative to",
    "it, and substitutes earn nothing: a second dress is not an accessory for a dress.",
    "The 'roles' table below groups types that fill the same slot, and anything in the",
    "same role group as the primary is excluded even if a list names it by mistake.",
    "",
    "Review this with a fashion eye. If a pairing looks wrong, it is wrong - these are",
    "judgements, not catalog facts."
